    "detailed_description": "On Point brings back the classic 90\u2019s arcade vibes with a fully immersive VR shooting gallery experience for all ages and skill levels. Blast your way through over 90 minigames full of wacky non-violent fun and challenge your speed, accuracy and reaction time with the classic light-gun feel. The return of the wacky shoot-em\u2019 up is here!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/6f12b88c61573e547b4c06c353616210.poster.avif?t=1752557002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/6f12b88c61573e547b4c06c353616210.webm?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/6f12b88c61573e547b4c06c353616210.mp4?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u>ABOUT</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compete in over 90 minigames.<br></li><li>Easy, medium and hard mode.<br></li><li>Local, global, and friends leaderboards.<br></li><li>Run riot through wacky arcade action.<br></li><li>Immersive VR experience, tuned for all experience and comfort levels.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/0a9b681499ad514c47b1310f5b8857a2.poster.avif?t=1752557002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/0a9b681499ad514c47b1310f5b8857a2.webm?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/0a9b681499ad514c47b1310f5b8857a2.mp4?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u>DESCRIPTION</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade style target shooting minigames.<br></li><li>Newcomer mode, low intensity, to ease players into VR.<br></li><li>Hardcore mode, for experienced players to challenge themselves and the leaderboards.<br></li><li>Fully in world experience.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/2f3117ea0ffe97294f2ccd635b09e83a.poster.avif?t=1752557002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/2f3117ea0ffe97294f2ccd635b09e83a.webm?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/2f3117ea0ffe97294f2ccd635b09e83a.mp4?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "On Point brings back the classic 90\u2019s arcade vibes with a fully immersive VR shooting gallery experience for all ages and skill levels. Blast your way through over 90 minigames full of wacky non-violent fun and challenge your speed, accuracy and reaction time with the classic light-gun feel. The return of the wacky shoot-em\u2019 up is here!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/6f12b88c61573e547b4c06c353616210.poster.avif?t=1752557002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/6f12b88c61573e547b4c06c353616210.webm?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/6f12b88c61573e547b4c06c353616210.mp4?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u>ABOUT</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compete in over 90 minigames.<br></li><li>Easy, medium and hard mode.<br></li><li>Local, global, and friends leaderboards.<br></li><li>Run riot through wacky arcade action.<br></li><li>Immersive VR experience, tuned for all experience and comfort levels.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/0a9b681499ad514c47b1310f5b8857a2.poster.avif?t=1752557002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/0a9b681499ad514c47b1310f5b8857a2.webm?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/0a9b681499ad514c47b1310f5b8857a2.mp4?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u>DESCRIPTION</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade style target shooting minigames.<br></li><li>Newcomer mode, low intensity, to ease players into VR.<br></li><li>Hardcore mode, for experienced players to challenge themselves and the leaderboards.<br></li><li>Fully in world experience.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/2f3117ea0ffe97294f2ccd635b09e83a.poster.avif?t=1752557002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/2f3117ea0ffe97294f2ccd635b09e83a.webm?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296750/extras/2f3117ea0ffe97294f2ccd635b09e83a.mp4?t=1752557002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "On Point is an arcade-inspired VR first person shooter, filled with Warioware-style minigames. Think, aim, and blast your way to a high score through endless shooting minigames, but don't hit those bombs or you'll run out of lives!",
